return ['domain'=>'zinn-campaigns','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-campaigns','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-13T22:50:58+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-13T22:50:58+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Campaigns – Email & SMS Marketing for WooCommerce & More'=>'Zinn® Campaigns – Email & SMS Marketing for WooCommerce & More','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-campaigns'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-campaigns','Connect your WordPress site or WooCommerce store to Zinn® Campaigns in one click and grow your list with double opt-in sign-up forms. Email, SMS and WhatsApp campaigns are sent from your Zinn® Campaigns account.'=>'Haɗa rukunin yanar gizonku na WordPress ko shagon WooCommerce zuwa Zinn® Campaigns da dannawa ɗaya kuma ku haɓaka jerinku tare da fom ɗin rajista na double opt-in. Ana aika kamfen ɗin imel, SMS da WhatsApp daga asusunku na Zinn® Campaigns.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','You are not allowed to manage Zinn® Campaigns on this site.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin sarrafa Zinn® Campaigns a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba.','This site is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon yana haɗe da Zinn® Campaigns.','This site is disconnected. Sign-up forms stop sending new sign-ups to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'An cire haɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizo. Fom ɗin yin rajista na daina aika sabbin rajista zuwa Zinn® Campaigns.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Wannan haɗin ya ɗauki lokaci mai tsawo ko an fara shi a wani burauza daban. Danna Haɗa kuma.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® bai karɓi haɗin ba. Latsa Haɗa kuma; idan ya ci gaba da kasawa, tuntuɓi tallafin Zinn®.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Shafinka ya kasa isa ga Zinn®. Tabbatar cewa mai masaukin bakinka yana ba da damar haɗin waje, sannan ka danna «Sake haɗawa».','The %s add-on'=>'Karin bayani na %s','You get Pro free with any paid Zinn® Campaigns plan: there is no separate licence to buy. Pro is a separate add-on plugin you download from your Zinn® dashboard.'=>'Kuna samun Pro kyauta tare da kowane shirin Zinn® Campaigns da aka biya: babu wani lasisi na daban da za a saya. Pro wani ƙarin manhaja (plugin) ne na daban da kuke saukewa daga allon sarrafawa na Zinn® ɗinku.','Included: your account has a paid Zinn® Campaigns plan.'=>'An haɗa: asusunku yana da tsarin Zinn® Campaigns da aka biya.','Free trial until %s. Pick any paid Zinn® Campaigns plan to keep Pro after that.'=>'Gwajin kyauta har zuwa %s. Zaɓi kowane tsarin biyan kuɗi na Zinn® Campaigns don ci gaba da riƙe Pro bayan haka.','Not included right now: the free trial has ended or the plan is not paid. Your Pro settings are kept and come back the moment a paid plan is live.'=>'Ba a haɗa shi ba a yanzu: gwajin kyauta ya ƙare ko kuma ba a biya kuɗin shirin ba. An adana saitunanku na Pro kuma za su dawo da zarar shirin da aka biya ya fara aiki.','Connect this site to see what your plan includes.'=>'Haɗa wannan shafin don ganin abin da shirinku ya ƙunsa.','Download the Pro add-on'=>'Sauke ƙarin Pro','See Zinn® Campaigns plans'=>'Duba tsare-tsaren Zinn® Campaigns','Sign-up forms'=>'Fom-fom ɗin rajista','Add the "Zinn® Campaigns sign-up form" block to any page or post, or paste a shortcode below. Every sign-up gets a confirmation e-mail first (double opt-in), and only people who confirm join your list.'=>'Ƙara shingen "Fom ɗin yin rajista na Zinn® Campaigns" a kowane shafi ko rubutu, ko liƙa gajeren lamba a ƙasa. Kowane yin rajista yana fara samun imel na tabbatarwa (shigarwa sau biyu), kuma mutanen da suka tabbatar ne kaɗai ke shiga jerinku.','Your account has no sign-up forms yet. Create one in your Zinn® dashboard under Campaigns, Forms, then press Refresh.'=>'Asusunka ba shi da fom ɗin yin rajista tukuna. Ƙirƙiri ɗaya a cikin allon sarrafawa na Zinn® a ƙarƙashin Yaƙin Neman Zaɓe, Fom-fom, sannan ka danna Sabunta.','Form'=>'Fom','List'=>'Jeri','Shortcode'=>'Gajeren lamba','Grow your list on this site with double opt-in sign-up forms, and send email, SMS and WhatsApp campaigns from your Zinn® Campaigns account.'=>'Haɓaka jerinku a wannan rukunin yanar gizon tare da fom ɗin rajista na tabbatarwa sau biyu, sannan ku aika kamfen ɗin imel, SMS da WhatsApp daga asusunku na Zinn® Campaigns.','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this site, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'"Haɗa" yana buɗe Zinn® a wannan taga. Shiga ko ƙirƙiri asusu, amince da wannan rukunin yanar gizon, kuma za ku dawo nan kai tsaye. Ba za ku taɓa liƙa kowane mabuɗi ba.','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Haɗa zuwa Zinn® Campaigns','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'An haɗa, amma ba a iya samun Zinn® ba a yanzu. Za mu sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba.','Site'=>'Shafi','Connected'=>'An haɗa','Open for your account'=>'A buɗe yake don asusunka','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'Ba a buɗe wa asusunka ba tukuna. Zinn® zai aiko maka da imel idan an buɗe.','Refresh'=>'Wartsake','Disconnect'=>'Cire haɗi','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin haɗa wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba.','You are not allowed to disconnect this site.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin cire haɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba.','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn® Campaigns sign-up form'=>'Fom ɗin rajista na Zinn® Campaigns','Choose a form'=>'Zaɓi fom','A double opt-in sign-up form from your Zinn® Campaigns account.'=>'Wani fam ɗin rajista na tabbatarwa sau biyu daga asusunka na Zinn® Campaigns.','Sign-up form'=>'Fom ɗin yin rajista','Zinn® Campaigns: connect this site and choose one of your forms to show a sign-up form here.'=>'Zinn® Campaigns: haɗa wannan rukunin yanar gizon kuma zaɓi ɗaya daga cikin fom ɗinku don nuna fom ɗin yin rajista a nan.','Sign up'=>'Yi rajista','Thank you. Check your inbox and click the link in our e-mail to confirm.'=>'Mun gode. Duba akwatin saƙonka sannan ka danna mahadar da ke cikin imel ɗinmu domin tabbatarwa.','Leave this empty'=>'Bar wannan a wofi','E-mail address'=>'Adireshin imel','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Littattafan jagora na mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani na %s','Hide this'=>'Ɓoye wannan','Zinn® Pro Membership: every Pro plugin, one licence'=>'Zinn® Pro Membership: kowace Pro manhaja, lasisi guda daya','The Pro versions of Page Builder Sandwich, Tranzly, Zinn® SEO, Zinn® Cache and Zinn® Backups, and every Pro plugin we release next, from %s a year. A second membership adds Zinn® Chat Pro.'=>'Sifofin Pro na Page Builder Sandwich, Tranzly, Zinn® SEO, Zinn® Cache da Zinn® Backups, da kuma kowane plugin na Pro da za mu fitar na gaba, daga %s a shekara. Zama memba na biyu yana ƙara Zinn® Chat Pro.','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Baƙuncin Zinn® don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, adana bayanan yau da kullum, sauya masauki kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina don mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da daya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwar Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayi kuma sayar da shafukan da aka kafa, yankuna da wuraren sanya hanyoyin haɗi, tare da ajiye kuɗin lafiya har sai ɓangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ɗauki mutanen da suka maida wannan sana\'arsu','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwar mu ta duniya don ƙwararrun masu zaman kansu: bincika ayyuka da aka riga aka shirya fiye da 10,000 daga marubuta, masu ƙira, masu haɓaka software da masana SEO, ko kuma ku saka aiki domin su gabatar da tayinsu.','Email me offers and reminders, including about items left in my cart. I can unsubscribe at any time.'=>'Aika mini tayi da masu tunatarwa ta imel, gami da game da abubuwan da aka bari a cikin kwandona. Zan iya cire rajista a kowane lokaci.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan sakin Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® bai bayar da hanyar saukarwa don wannan sabuntawa ba. Bincika cewa wannan rukunin yanar gizon zai iya isa ga dandalin Zinn®, sannan ka sake gwadawa.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya sauke sabuntawar daga sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® (%s) ba. Sake gwadawa bayan \'yan mintuna.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka saukar ta gaza wajen binciken inganci kuma ba a shigar da ita ba.']];